{
  "id": "piranport:ammo_wheel",
  "items": [
    "piranport:single_small_gun",
    "piranport:small_he_shell",
    "piranport:small_ap_shell",
    "piranport:small_vt_shell",
    "piranport:small_type3_shell"
  ],
  "title": {
    "zh_cn": "皮兰港：弹药轮盘",
    "en_us": "Piran Port: Ammo Wheel"
  },
  "tags": ["piranport", "ammo", "artillery"],
  "editable": false,
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "open_wheel",
      "title": {
        "zh_cn": "按住 Tab 打开轮盘",
        "en_us": "Hold Tab to Open the Wheel"
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "type": "show_structure",
          "structure": "ponderer:basic"
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 20
        },
        {
          "type": "create_item_entity",
          "item": "piranport:single_small_gun",
          "pos": [2, 1, 2]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "变身后手持火炮，按住 Tab 键呼出弹药轮盘——轮盘会列出背包里与本炮口径匹配的全部弹种。",
            "en_us": "While transformed, hold a cannon and press and hold Tab to summon the ammo wheel — it lists every shell in your inventory that fits this gun's caliber."
          },
          "point": [2.5, 2.2, 2.5],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 90
        },
        {
          "type": "create_item_entity",
          "pos": [1.5, 3.5, 2.5],
          "motion": [0.0, -0.03, 0.0],
          "count": 1,
          "item": "piranport:small_he_shell",
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "create_item_entity",
          "pos": [3.5, 3.5, 2.5],
          "motion": [0.0, -0.03, 0.0],
          "count": 1,
          "item": "piranport:small_ap_shell",
          "attachKeyFrame": false
        },
        {
          "type": "create_item_entity",
          "pos": [2.5, 3.5, 1.5],
          "motion": [0.0, -0.03, 0.0],
          "count": 1,
          "item": "piranport:small_vt_shell",
          "attachKeyFrame": false
        },
        {
          "type": "create_item_entity",
          "pos": [2.5, 3.5, 3.5],
          "motion": [0.0, -0.03, 0.0],
          "count": 1,
          "item": "piranport:small_type3_shell",
          "attachKeyFrame": false
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 90,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "弹种只有伤害型四种：HE（榴弹）溅射、AP（穿甲弹）破甲、VT（近炸引信）对空、三式弹防空弹幕。",
            "en_us": "Four damage shell types only: HE for splash, AP for armor, VT for proximity-fuzed air targets, Type-3 for AA barrage."
          },
          "point": [2.5, 3.6, 2.5],
          "color": "input",
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 100
        },
        {
          "type": "indicate_success",
          "blockPos": [2, 1, 2],
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "移动鼠标指向想要的弹种，松开 Tab 即完成切换。切换不收钱不读条，下一轮齐射就用新弹种。",
            "en_us": "Hover the cursor over the shell you want and release Tab to confirm. Switching is free and instant — the next salvo uses the new type."
          },
          "point": [2.5, 1.5, 2.5],
          "color": "green",
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 90
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "wheel_limits",
      "title": {
        "zh_cn": "使用限制",
        "en_us": "Limitations"
      },
      "steps": [
        {
          "type": "show_structure",
          "structure": "ponderer:basic"
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 20
        },
        {
          "type": "create_item_entity",
          "item": "piranport:single_small_gun",
          "pos": [2, 1, 2]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "轮盘只在变身舰娘状态下、主手持火炮且不在侦察机视角时可用。空手或手持鱼雷发射器按 Tab 没反应。",
            "en_us": "The wheel only works while transformed, cannon in main hand, and not in recon view. Empty hand or a torpedo launcher gets no response from Tab."
          },
          "point": [2.5, 2.2, 2.5],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 90
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "小口径炮吃小弹、中口径吃中弹、大口径吃大弹——弹种再大也塞不进小炮，轮盘里不会出现不匹配口径。",
            "en_us": "Small guns take small shells, medium take medium, large take large. The wheel never offers a caliber your gun can't chamber."
          },
          "point": [2.5, 2.8, 2.5],
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 90
        },
        {
          "type": "indicate_success",
          "blockPos": [2, 1, 2],
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "duration": 80,
          "text": {
            "zh_cn": "Tab 是默认键位，和其他快捷键冲突时在选项→控制里改绑。",
            "en_us": "Tab is the default binding — rebind it under Options → Controls if it collides with another key."
          },
          "point": [2.5, 1.5, 2.5],
          "color": "green",
          "placeNearTarget": true,
          "attachKeyFrame": true
        },
        {
          "type": "idle",
          "duration": 90
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
